        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d8e8611d-9efa-33f5-8b2a-74d3b439091d",
                "word": "tranentrekker",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9b08f35d-3faa-464e-a195-2fd530e232b6",
                        "entry_id": "d8e8611d-9efa-33f5-8b2a-74d3b439091d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tranentrekkers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                        "entry_id": "d8e8611d-9efa-33f5-8b2a-74d3b439091d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een lied, boek, film of toneelstuk met veel (vals) sentiment"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "222cdab8-2788-4750-81bc-0bc9e4c83df1",
                                "sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                                "text": "De brunette, die zich onlangs verloofde met haar grote liefde platenlabelmedewerker Erik Zwennes, verklapt aan Beau Monde dat het Holland Zingt Hazes-publiek niet hoeft te rekenen op een familieduet. \"Nee, dat is vals sentiment opbouwen. Het eerste jaar zong ik een postuum een duet met mijn vader, dat was emotioneel. We gaan niet ieder jaar voor een tranentrekker zorgen, maar zullen elkaar ook niet ontlopen op het podium.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b967e9b-b421-454e-a7a4-e7bfea1a6806",
                                "sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                                "text": "De 13-jarige Abobaker Rahman, die vier jaar geleden met zijn ouders en broer en zus uit de Afghaanse stad Kaboel vluchtte, heeft gisteravond diepe indruk gemaakt in de Belgische versie van The Voice Kids. De jongen haalde moeiteloos de allerhoogste noten van Céline Dions wereldberoemde Titanic-tranentrekker My Heart Will Go On. 'Voor iedereen die in een gammel bootje naar Europa komt'. Zijn imposante optreden heeft internationaal voor kippenvel gezorgd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55bd7abd-c75a-4039-a640-9b01a2f9af24",
                                "sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                                "text": "We leven allemaal op hoop. Want zonder hoop zou er niets meer zijn. Boxell schreef de tranentrekker I Miss You."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b9ae4c2-d78f-479b-a057-21d9e3c9eedf",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8e8611d-9efa-33f5-8b2a-74d3b439091d",
                        "source_sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                        "target_lang_word": "sob story",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sob story",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dad97d2f-31a9-3dba-8fb7-1aa01d5be6d8",
                                        "entry_id": "66394543-361d-3357-bc15-f6525d3a8104",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sad story, especially one intended to elicit sympathy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a56e61af-7902-4c14-8017-ea632d9e7ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "dad97d2f-31a9-3dba-8fb7-1aa01d5be6d8",
                                                "text": "\"Dis picture is called De Tale o' Two Cities, and it's de French revolution. It's about a feller vot takes anodder feller's place and gits his head cut off; and say, dere's a sob story in it vot's a vunder.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3cdeefe-d596-4759-9cdf-fa148a7de203",
                                                "sense_id": "dad97d2f-31a9-3dba-8fb7-1aa01d5be6d8",
                                                "text": "Mr. Martin objected at first to the bastardization of my talent, but I gave him a sob story about needing money for lessons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f8ef7ad-56d0-499f-90fb-81ef772950d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8e8611d-9efa-33f5-8b2a-74d3b439091d",
                        "source_sense_id": "924c83d6-b8f9-36b8-8be8-da64b2ee56fc",
                        "target_lang_word": "tearjerker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tearjerker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d001dd50-b2fa-3540-9b69-7dbf5feee89b",
                                        "entry_id": "21d4220c-4b06-332d-92a4-47cdb654fae1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An emotionally charged film, novel, song, opera, television episode, etc., usually with one or more sad passages or ending, so termed because it suggests one is likely to cry during its performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31b37cb8-340a-4c0f-b6a9-59c010731515",
                                                "sense_id": "d001dd50-b2fa-3540-9b69-7dbf5feee89b",
                                                "text": "Renamed in honor of the tube tearjerker, the work wondrously went on to become the most recognized theme in all of soapdom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f62d8480-d2f7-41f6-9b6c-476092a392a3",
                                                "sense_id": "d001dd50-b2fa-3540-9b69-7dbf5feee89b",
                                                "text": "The psychologist Paul Rozin lumps tearjerkers with other examples of benign masochism like smoking, riding on roller coasters, eating hot chili peppers, and sitting in saunas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf8e6103-8d40-4e12-a1b8-0be4678477e5",
                                                "sense_id": "d001dd50-b2fa-3540-9b69-7dbf5feee89b",
                                                "text": "The many tear-jerkers deal with finality, with death and the end of love, with a stoicism pregnant with feeling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
